OCPARTICLE 1
NAME Ground Mist
# A slow-drifting fog wisp -- not smoke, not steam, not a weapon effect: ambient ground haze that
# just sits and thins. Exercises the format's own grammar as real authored content, loaded through
# GameContent::loadProjectParticleEffects / SandboxApp's loadProjectParticleEffects (particles
# slice 5), not through --particle-test's hardcoded structs.
SHAPE box 260 260 20
BLEND alphablend
EMISSION 12 0 60
LIFETIME 8 12
DIRECTION 0 0 1 25
SPEED 2 6
GRAVITY 0 0 0.4
DAMPING 0.15
SIZE 60 140
COLOR start 0.82 0.85 0.88 0
COLOR end 0.82 0.85 0.88 0.18
GI on
